<p><a href="https://bank.example.com@evil.example.net/login" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">https://bank.example.com</a></p>
<p><a href="http://192.0.2.44/login" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">Secure portal</a></p>
<p><a href="https://xn--pple-43d.com/" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">аpple.com</a></p>
<p><a href="https://help.bank.example.com/faq" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">help.bank.example.com/faq</a> (this one is fine)</p>
